<title>CHINA: China discovers high-yield oil well in Bohai.</title>
<headline>China discovers high-yield oil well in Bohai.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has discovered a high-yield oil well in the Bohai Bay recently, the Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new well, about 10 km offshore, could produce 1,699 tonnes of oil a day, it said. The well was found by the China National Petroleum Corporation, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>It gave no more details of the find.</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
